WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.326
A responsible improvement gives an incomplete request a clear owner, a status, and a safe next action.

00:00:06.326 --> 00:00:10.419
AI could organize approved notes or draft a clarification for review.

00:00:10.419 --> 00:00:13.024
It cannot approve a price or promise.

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:18.233
The human reviewer remains accountable, and the improved step directly addresses the missing-input handoff.
